<item>
            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1972] IgniteInterpreter spoils current thread&apos;s context classloader</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1972</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;IgniteInterpreter uses &lt;tt&gt;scala.tools.nsc.interpreter.IMain&lt;/tt&gt; and every call to IMain.interpret changes context classloader. It is a known scala issue.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;It causes some issues including test failures.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;See &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-9587&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-9587&lt;/a&gt; for more details&lt;/p&gt;</description>
