                            <comment id="15827728" author="githubbot" created="Wed, 18 Jan 2017 09:40:02 +0000"  >&lt;p&gt;GitHub user DrIgor opened a pull request:&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1911&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://github.com/apache/zeppelin/pull/1911&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1972&quot; title=&quot;IgniteInterpreter spoils current thread&amp;#39;s context classloader&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1972&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1972&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt; Preserve context classloader&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;ol&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;What is this PR for?&lt;br/&gt;
    `IMain.interpret` changes current thread&apos;s context classloader. It may cause different issues and definitely is the reason of &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1738&quot; title=&quot;IgniteSqlInterpreterTest fails the build \w Scala 2.11&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;ZEPPELIN-1738&quot;&gt;&lt;del&gt;ZEPPELIN-1738&lt;/del&gt;&lt;/a&gt;(&lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1738&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1738&lt;/a&gt;) test failures.&lt;/li&gt;
		&lt;/ol&gt;
		&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;/ol&gt;
	&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;


&lt;p&gt;    It&apos;s a known scala bug. See &lt;a href=&quot;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-9587&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://issues.scala-lang.org/browse/SI-9587&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;    As a workaround we need to save and restore context classloader manually&lt;/p&gt;

