	&lt;li&gt;
	&lt;ol&gt;
		&lt;li&gt;
		&lt;ol&gt;
			&lt;li&gt;How should this be tested?&lt;br/&gt;
    Run ignite interpreter test and ignite sql interpreter test in the same thread&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;br/&gt;
    mvn test -pl ignite -am -Pscala-2.11 -Dtest=org.apache.zeppelin.ignite.IgniteInterpreterTest#testInterpret,org.apache.zeppelin.ignite.IgniteSqlInterpreterTest#testSql -DfailIfNoTests=false&lt;br/&gt;
    ```&lt;/li&gt;
